  "description": {"zh-CN": "由房间模板组合而成的两层教学医院：一层为入口大厅、急诊（抢救单元与隔间）、放射科（CT 与 X 线/透视）、检验科、药房（调配区仅限药师和护士）、门诊和骨科诊室及急诊护士站；二层为内科病房、ICU、示教室、康复训练室和手术室（无菌区限制进入）。主楼梯与电梯连接两层。", "en": "A two-storey teaching hospital composed from room templates. Ground floor: entrance lobby, emergency department (resus bays and cubicles), radiology (CT, X-ray and fluoroscopy), clinical laboratory, pharmacy (dispensary for pharmacists and nurses only), outpatient and orthopaedic rooms and the ED nursing station. First floor: medical wards, ICU, teaching room, rehabilitation gym and the operating theatre (restricted sterile area). Main stairs and an elevator join the floors."},
